ch płatności','Could not reach the license server, but your license was last verified %d hour(s) ago and remains active.'=>'Nie można połączyć się z serwerem licencji, ale Twoja licencja została zweryfikowana %d godz. temu i pozostaje aktywna.','Displays the booking search and reservation form. Use [mhbo_booking_form] or [modern_hotel_booking].'=>'Wyświetla formularz wyszukiwania i rezerwacji. Użyj [mhbo_booking_form] lub [modern_hotel_booking].','Displays a grid of room types. Attributes: columns, limit.'=>'Wyświetla siatkę typów pokoi. Atrybuty: columns, limit.','Displays the availability calendar for a specific room. Attribute: room_id.'=>'Wyświetla kalendarz dostępności dla określonego pokoju. Atrybut: room_id.','Embeds the AI Concierge chat widget. Attributes: variant, position, welcome_message, theme.'=>'Osadza widżet czatu konsjerża AI. Atrybuty: variant, position, welcome_message, theme.','Available placeholders: {customer_name}, {customer_email}, {customer_phone}, {site_name}, {booking_id}, {booking_token}, {booking_reference}, {status}, {check_in}, {check_out}, {check_in_time}, {check_out_time}, {nights}, {total_price}, {guests}, {children}, {children_ages}, {children_total}, {room_name}, {room_number}, {custom_fields}, {booking_extras}, {extras}, {extras_text}, {payment_details}, {tax_breakdown}, {tax_breakdown_text}, {tax_total}, {tax_registration_number}, {company_name}, {company_address}, {company_phone}, {company_email}, {company_website}, {company_registration}, {whatsapp_number}, {whatsapp_link}, {view_url}, {special_requests}, {arrival_time}'=>'Dostępne symbole zastępcze: {customer_name}, {customer_email}, {customer_phone}, {site_name}, {booking_id}, {booking_token}, {booking_reference}, {status}, {check_in}, {check_out}, {check_in_time}, {check_out_time}, {nights}, {total_price}, {guests}, {children}, {children_ages}, {children_total}, {room_name}, {room_number}, {custom_fields}, {booking_extras}, {extras}, {extras_text}, {payment_details}, {tax_b